   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie av IVI 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability study of IVI 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser en studie av International Vaccine Institute, IVI d&#xe4;r uppdragsbeskrivningen innefattar att bland annat bed&#xf6;ma h&#xe5;llbarheten i IVI:s finansiering, liksom hur producerade vacciner ska f&#xe5; st&#xf6;rre avs&#xe4;ttning. Studien f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas ge underlag f&#xf6;r s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l andra potentiella finansi&#xe4;rer av IVI liksom f&#xf6;r Sidas eventuella framtida st&#xf6;d till IVI.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is for a study on the sustainability of International Vaccine Institute&apos;s, (IVI&apos;s) research results as well as the uptake up vaccines produced by the institute.</narrative>
  </description>
